        "learnerExperience": "Recap and prediction (about 4 minutes). The teacher displays the board from Lesson 7 with the three predictions of the shared area (the Prediction Bank), and the results AM = 30 m, MB = 19 m, PM ≈ 29.39 m, α ≈ 44.41°, β ≈ 57.12°. In pairs learners say what each number is and which formula from Lessons 5 and 6 will turn the angles into areas. Each learner then writes a revised estimate of the lens area, with a one-sentence reason, below their first prediction.",
