        "teacherMoves": "Say: 'Your trace is real evidence. Do the calculated angles agree with what your protractor shows?' Circulate; check that the protractor is placed on the centre, not on the chord. Cold-call 2 groups to give their measured angle PAQ. Say: 'Agreement within about 2 or 3 degrees tells us the method is sound. Notice that the protractor reads the FULL angle PAQ (about 89°), which is twice the angle α used in the cosine ratio.' Do not state the area yet.",
