      "purposeInStoryline": "In Lesson 9 the farmer's plans combined an annular sector with a segment and a circle with a segment. Lesson 10 adds the last two situations, two overlapping fish ponds in Mombasa and a composite Laikipia fencing plan, and gives learners the chance to check each other's solutions, as a real engineer would before signing off a design.",
