      "purposeInStoryline": "This is the first of two culminating lessons. Learners have met every formula over Lessons 1–10; Lesson 11 tests them, in the setting of the Laikipia farmer's field, and lets learners see which formula still needs work. Lesson 12 is then used to revise the model and answer the driving question.",
